{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-62-1","title":"Psalms 62:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":62,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":62,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David, professing his confidence in God, discourages his enemies. 5 In the same confidence he encourages the godly. 9 No trust is to be put in worldly things. 11 Power and mercy belong to God.</p>\n<p>(Title.) Jeduthun. 39:1; 77:1; *titles 1Ch 16:41,42; 25:1,3 Truly. or, Only. 2,5,6 my soul. 25:5; 27:14; 33:20; 40:1; 123:2; 130:5,6; Isa 30:18; 40:31 La 3:25,38; Jas 5:7 waiteth. Heb. is silent. 37:7; 65:1; *marg: from. 37:39; 68:19,20; 121:2; Isa 12:2; Jer 3:23; Lu 2:30-32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-62-2","title":"Psalms 62:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":62,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":62,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>He only. 6; 18:2; 21:1; 27:1; 73:25,26; De 32:30,31; Isa 26:4; 32:2 defence. Heb. high place. 59:9,17; *marg: I shall. 37:24; Mic 7:8,9; 1Co 10:13; 2Co 4:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-62-3","title":"Psalms 62:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":62,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":62,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>How. 4:2; 82:2; Ex 10:3; 16:28; Pr 1:22; 6:9; Jer 4:14; Mt 17:17 imagine. 21:11; 38:12; 140:2; Ho 7:15 ye shall. 73:18-20; 1Sa 26:10 bowing. Isa 30:13,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-62-4","title":"Psalms 62:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":62,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":62,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>consult. 2:1-3; Mt 2:3,4,16; 22:15,23,34,35; 26:3,4; 27:1; Joh 11:47-50 Ac 4:16,17,25-28 delight. 52:3; 119:163; Pr 6:17; 13:5; Ho 7:3; Joh 8:44; Ro 1:32; Re 22:15 bless. 28:3; 55:21; Lu 20:20 inwardly. Heb. in their inward parts. 5:9; 51:6; Lu 11:39; Ro 7:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-62-5","title":"Psalms 62:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":62,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":62,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>soul. 42:5,11; 43:5; 103:1,2; 104:1,35; 146:1 wait. 1,2; 27:13,14; 37:34; La 3:24-26; Mic 7:7; Hab 2:3; Zep 3:8 Joh 6:67-69 my. 39:7; 71:5; Jer 17:17; Php 1:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-62-6","title":"Psalms 62:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":62,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":62,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>rock. 2; 18:31,32; Isa 45:17; Ho 1:7 I shall. 16:8; 112:6; Pr 10:30; 12:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-62-7","title":"Psalms 62:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":62,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":62,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>In God. Isa 45:25; Jer 3:23; 9:23,24; 1Co 1:30,31; Ga 6:14 glory. 3:3; 4:2 rock. 18:2,46; 94:22; 95:1; Isa 26:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-62-8","title":"Psalms 62:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":62,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":62,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Trust. 22:4,5; 34:1,2; 47:1-3; Job 13:15; Isa 26:4; 50:10; 1Jo 2:28 pour. 42:4; 102:1; *title 142:2; 1Sa 1:15; Isa 26:16; La 2:19; Php 4:6 God. 18:2; 46:11; Pr 14:26; Heb 6:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-62-9","title":"Psalms 62:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":62,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":62,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Surely. 39:5,11; 1Sa 18:5,7; 23:12,19,20; 2Sa 15:6; Mt 21:9; Joh 19:15 of high. 55:13,14; 118:9; 1Sa 18:21-26; 26:21-25; 2Sa 15:31; Ro 3:4 laid. Da 5:27 altogether. or, alike. lighter. Isa 40:15,17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-62-10","title":"Psalms 62:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":62,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":62,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Trust. Job 20:19,29; Isa 28:15; 30:12; 47:10; 59:4; Jer 13:25; 17:11 riches. 39:6; 52:7; De 6:10-12; 8:12-14; Job 27:16-23; 31:24,25; Mr 8:36,37 Mr 10:23; Lu 12:15-21; 1Ti 6:17 set. 91:14; Pr 23:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-62-11","title":"Psalms 62:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":62,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":62,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>spoken. Job 33:14; 40:5 power. or, strength. 68:34,35; Isa 26:4; Mt 6:13; 28:18; Joh 19:11; Re 19:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-62-12","title":"Psalms 62:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":62,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":62,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>mercy. 86:15; 103:8,17; Ex 34:6,7; Da 9:9,18; Mic 7:18 renderest. Job 34:11; Pr 24:12; Jer 32:19; Eze 7:27; 18:30; 33:20; Mt 16:27 Ro 2:6; 1Co 3:8; 2Co 5:10; Eph 6:8; Col 3:25; 1Pe 1:17; Re 22:12</p>"}]}